# Solana Minting Safety

- Reuse the existing wallet adapter and shared Solana configuration for any minting flow.
- Keep editorial publication state separate from mint ownership or collectible state.
- Verify paid mints and completion server-side from confirmed transactions before persisting app-side effects.
- Avoid coupling creator publishing to minting; minting must remain opt-in per work or release.
- Prefer additive mint records and entitlement tables over embedding on-chain assumptions across the UI.
- Keep chain configuration centralized and never scatter program, collection, or tree identifiers across components.
